# Next.js Best Practices

## App Router Structure
- Using Next.js 14 App Router with `src/app/` directory
- Main layout in [src/app/layout.tsx](mdc:src/app/layout.tsx) with Lexend font, Portuguese locale, and dark theme
- Home page in [src/app/page.tsx](mdc:src/app/page.tsx) with component composition and min-height

## Font Optimization
- Using Google Fonts with Next.js font optimization
- Lexend font imported in layout for consistent typography
- Font applied globally via className in body element

## Image Optimization
- Always use Next.js `Image` component instead of `<img>` tags
- Import images from `src/img/` directory using `@/img/` alias
- Set appropriate width, height, and alt attributes for accessibility
- Use Sharp package for production image optimization
- Profile images use `rounded-full` with border and shadow effects

## Metadata Configuration
- Set proper metadata in layout.tsx: title, language (pt-br)
- SEO-friendly title: "Luís Henrique Wendt | Desenvolvedor Full Stack"
- Dark theme applied via `className="dark"` on html element

## Static Assets
- Resume PDF stored in [public/curriculo.pdf](mdc:public/curriculo.pdf)
- Static images and icons in [public/](mdc:public/) directory
- Use proper file naming conventions

## Performance Considerations
- Components are properly structured for optimal rendering
- Use of Lucide React icons for scalable vector icons
- shadcn/ui components for consistent and optimized UI
- Framer Motion animations optimized for 60fps performance
- Efficient component composition without unnecessary re-renders
- Dark theme with CSS variables for optimal performance
- Animation variants defined outside components to prevent re-creation

## Configuration Files
- [next.config.mjs](mdc:next.config.mjs) - Next.js configuration
- [tailwind.config.ts](mdc:tailwind.config.ts) - Tailwind CSS with shadcn/ui theme, dark mode, and custom container
- [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json) - TypeScript configuration with path aliases
- [components.json](mdc:components.json) - shadcn/ui configuration
- [src/lib/utils.ts](mdc:src/lib/utils.ts) - Utility functions for shadcn/ui

## Dependencies
- Next.js 14.2.5 with App Router
- React 18 with TypeScript
- shadcn/ui components for consistent UI
- Lucide React for modern icons
- Framer Motion for animations and transitions
- Sharp for image optimization
- Tailwind CSS with dark theme support

## Development Scripts
- `npm run dev` - Development server
- `npm run build` - Production build
- `npm run start` - Production server
- `npm run lint` - ESLint checking